msgstr "Gunakan ikon baku"

#: includes/admin/views/settings-page.php:248
msgid ""
"PNG, JPG, GIF, WebP, or SVG. Default plugin icon is used when none is "
"selected."
msgstr ""
"PNG, JPG, GIF, WebP, atau SVG. Ikon plugin bawaan dipakai ketika tak ada "
"yang dipilih."

