msgstr ""
"Perintah kadaluarsa berisik di toko sibuk, itulah sebabnya mereka pergi "
"untuk memulai."

#: includes/admin/views/settings-page.php:448
msgid ""
"Send one message a day: what was paid, what it came to, and what still needs"
