#: includes/class-xdwp-privacy.php:43
msgid "Overpaid amount"
msgstr "Jumlah overpaid"

#: includes/class-xdwp-privacy.php:44
msgid "Late payment transaction ID"
msgstr "ID transaksi pembayaran akhir"

#: includes/class-xdwp-privacy.php:45
msgid "Late payment amount"
msgstr "Jumlah pembayaran terlambat"

#: includes/class-xdwp-privacy.php:47
msgid "Transaction seen before confirmation"
msgstr "Transaksi terlihat sebelum konfirmasi"

#: includes/class-xdwp-privacy.php:48
msgid "Payment note (part paid, overpaid, late)"
msgstr "Catatan pembayaran (bagian dibayar, overpaid, terlambat)"

#: includes/class-xdwp-privacy.php:186
msgid ""
"Xorro Wallet Payments: coin, address, amount, and transaction-ID metadata on"
" crypto orders was retained for payment verification and merchant "
"accounting/dispute records, consistent with how order data is kept after "
"uninstalling the plugin."
msgstr ""
"Xorro Wallet Payments: koin, alamat, jumlah, dan transaksi- ID metadata pada"
" perintah kripto ditahan untuk pembayaran verifikasi dan catatan akuntansi /"
" sengketa pedagang, konsisten dengan bagaimana urutan data disimpan setelah "
"uninstall plugin."

#: includes/class-xdwp-privacy.php:205
msgid ""
"Xorro Direct Wallet Payments for WooCommerce lets customers pay with "
"cryptocurrency directly to store wallets. The plugin does not send data to "
"the plugin author’s servers."
msgstr ""
"Dompet Langsung Xorro Payment untuk WooCommerce memungkinkan pelanggan "
"membayar dengan cryptocie langsung untuk menyimpan dompet. Plugin tidak "
"mengirim data ke server penulis plugin."

#: includes/class-xdwp-privacy.php:207
msgid "What is stored locally"
msgstr "Apa yang disimpan secara lokal"

#: includes/class-xdwp-privacy.php:209
msgid "Public cryptocurrency receiving addresses you configure."
msgstr "Mata uang publik menerima alamat yang kau konfigurasi."

#: includes/class-xdwp-privacy.php:210
msgid ""
"Order metadata needed to match payments (selected coin, quoted amount, "
"assigned address, payment status)."
msgstr ""
"Pesan metadata yang diperlukan untuk mencocokkan pembayaran (koin, jumlah "
"kutipan, alamat yang diberikan, status pembayaran)."

#: includes/class-xdwp-privacy.php:213
msgid "Third-party services"
msgstr "Tiga puluh layanan partai"

#: includes/class-xdwp-privacy.php:214
msgid ""
"When a customer uses this payment method, or when automatic verification is "
"enabled, the store may contact public blockchain and price APIs. Typical "
"data includes coin identifiers, wallet addresses, transaction IDs, and fiat "
"currency codes. Optional API keys you add are sent only to the matching "
"provider."
msgstr ""
"Ketika pelanggan menggunakan metode pembayaran ini, atau ketika verifikasi "
"otomatis diaktifkan, toko dapat menghubungi blockchain publik dan harga "
"APIs. Data umum termasuk pengidentifikasi koin, alamat dompet, ID transaksi,"
" dan kode mata uang fiat. Tombol API opsional yang Anda tambahkan hanya "
"dikirim ke penyedia yang cocok."

#: includes/class-xdwp-privacy.php:216
msgid "CoinGecko — exchange rates for crypto quotes."
msgstr "CoinGecko - nilai tukar untuk kutipan crypto."

#: includes/class-xdwp-privacy.php:217
msgid "Etherscan API V2 — EVM chain payment detection."
msgstr "Etherscan API V2 - EVM pelacakan rantai deteksi."

#: includes/class-xdwp-privacy.php:218
msgid "mempool.space / Blockstream — Bitcoin payment detection."
msgstr "mempool.space / Blockstream - pendeteksi pembayaran Bitcoin."

#: includes/class-xdwp-privacy.php:219
msgid "Blockchair — Bitcoin Cash / Litecoin / Dogecoin payment detection."
msgstr "Blockchair - Bitcoin Cash / Litecoin / Dogecoin pelacakan deteksi."

#: includes/class-xdwp-privacy.php:220
msgid ""
"TronGrid, Solana RPC / Helius, and other public explorers/RPCs for supported"
" networks."
msgstr ""
"TronGrid, Solana RPC / Helius, dan penjelajah publik lainnya / RPC untuk "
"jaringan yang didukung."

#: includes/class-xdwp-privacy.php:223
msgid ""
"Automatic on-chain verification can be disabled under Xorro Wallet Payments "
"→ General. Disabling the payment gateway stops these checkout-related "
"requests."
msgstr ""
"Otomatis on- rantai verifikasi dapat dinonaktifkan di bawah Xorro Wallet "
"Payments Jenderal. Menonaktifkan gerbang pembayaran menghentikan permintaan "
"checkout- terkait."

#: includes/class-xdwp-refunds.php:127
msgid "A refund link was created for the customer to give a receiving address"
msgstr ""
"Sebuah link pengembalian dana dibuat untuk pelanggan untuk memberikan alamat"
" penerima"

#: includes/class-xdwp-refunds.php:200
msgid "Too many attempts. Please wait a few minutes and open the link again."
msgstr ""
"Terlalu banyak usaha. Harap tunggu beberapa menit dan membuka link lagi."

#: includes/class-xdwp-refunds.php:207
msgid ""
"This refund link is not valid, or it has expired. Ask the shop for a new "
"one."
msgstr ""
"Taut pengembalian uang ini tak valid, atau sudah kadaluarsa. Mintalah yang "
"baru."

#: includes/class-xdwp-refunds.php:219
msgid "This refund has already been sent."
msgstr "Kembalikan ini sudah dikirim."

#: includes/class-xdwp-refunds.php:225
msgid "Enter the address you want the refund sent to."
msgstr "Masukkan alamat yang ingin dikembalikan."

#. translators: %s: coin name and network
#: includes/class-xdwp-refunds.php:230
#, php-format
msgid ""
"That does not look like a %s address. Check it in your wallet and try again "
"— money sent to a wrong address cannot be recovered."
msgstr ""
"Itu tidak terlihat seperti alamat %s. Periksa di dompet Anda dan coba lagi -"
" uang yang dikirim ke alamat yang salah tidak dapat dipulihkan."

#: includes/class-xdwp-refunds.php:235
msgid ""
"Thank you. The shop has your address and will send the refund from their own"
" wallet."
msgstr ""
"Terima kasih. Toko memiliki alamat Anda dan akan mengirim pengembalian dana "
"dari dompet mereka sendiri."

#. translators: %s: receiving address
#: includes/class-xdwp-refunds.php:258
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The customer asked for their refund to be sent to %s. Send it from your own "
"wallet, then record the transaction id on this order."
msgstr ""
"Pelanggan meminta pengembalian dana mereka untuk dikirim ke %s. Kirim dari "
"dompetmu sendiri, lalu rekam tanda transaksi pada pesanan ini."

#. translators: %s: receiving address
#: includes/class-xdwp-refunds.php:267
#, php-format
msgid "The customer gave a refund address (%s)"
msgstr "Pelanggan memberikan alamat pengembalian (%s)"

#. translators: 1: amount and coin, 2: transaction id
#: includes/class-xdwp-refunds.php:315
#, php-format
msgid "Refund of %1$s sent, transaction %2$s."
msgstr "Kembalikan %1$s yang dikirim, transaksi %2$s."

#. translators: %s: transaction id
#: includes/class-xdwp-refunds.php:326
#, php-format
msgid "The shop sent the refund (%s)"
msgstr "Toko mengirim pengembalian (%s)"

#: includes/class-xdwp-refunds.php:397
msgid ""
"Refund link created. Copy it from the order and send it to the customer — it"
" is shown for fifteen minutes."
msgstr ""
"Link pengembalian dana dibuat. Salin dari pesanan dan kirim ke pelanggan - "
"itu ditampilkan selama lima belas menit."

#: includes/class-xdwp-refunds.php:398
msgid "Refund recorded."
msgstr "Refunt direkam."

#: includes/class-xdwp-refunds.php:399
msgid "Enter the transaction id of the refund you sent."
msgstr "Masukkan id transaksi pengembalian dana yang Anda kirim."

#: includes/class-xdwp-refunds.php:400
msgid "That refund link will no longer open."
msgstr "Link pengembalian dana itu tidak akan lagi terbuka."

#: includes/class-xdwp-refunds.php:401
msgid "That refund could not be dealt with."
msgstr "Pengembalian uang itu tidak bisa ditangani."

#: includes/class-xdwp-selftest.php:48
msgid "This coin is not one the plugin knows about."
msgstr "Koin ini bukan salah satu plugin tahu tentang."

#: includes/class-xdwp-selftest.php:88
msgid "Gateway switched on"
msgstr "Gateway diaktifkan"

#: includes/class-xdwp-selftest.php:91
msgid "Customers can choose it at checkout."
msgstr "Pelanggan bisa memilih di kasir."

#: includes/class-xdwp-selftest.php:92
msgid ""
"The gateway is off in WooCommerce → Settings → Payments, so nobody can pay "
"with it yet."
msgstr ""
"Gateway ini tidak aktif di WooCommerce Controlant Develments, sehingga tidak"
" ada yang bisa membayar dengan itu belum."

#: includes/class-xdwp-selftest.php:99 includes/class-xdwp-selftest.php:103
#: includes/class-xdwp-selftest.php:114
msgid "Payment checks scheduled"
msgstr "Pemeriksaan pembayaran dijadwalkan"

#: includes/class-xdwp-selftest.php:99
msgid ""
"The recurring payment check is not scheduled. Deactivating and reactivating "
"the plugin restores it."
msgstr ""
"Pemeriksaan pembayaran yang berulang tidak dijadwalkan. Menonaktifkan dan "
"mengaktifkan kembali plugin menyimpannya."

#. translators: %s: human-readable time difference
#: includes/class-xdwp-selftest.php:107
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The check was due %s ago and has not run. WordPress only runs scheduled "
"tasks when someone visits the site — a quiet shop should use a real cron job"
" on the server."
msgstr ""
"Cek itu karena %s yang lalu dan belum berjalan. WordPress hanya menjalankan "
"tugas yang dijadwalkan ketika seseorang mengunjungi situs - toko tenang "
"harus menggunakan pekerjaan kron nyata di server."

#. translators: %s: human-readable time difference
#: includes/class-xdwp-selftest.php:118
#, php-format
msgid "Next check in %s."
msgstr "Pemeriksaan berikutnya dalam %s."

#: includes/class-xdwp-selftest.php:125
msgid "WordPress scheduler"
msgstr "Penjadwalan WordPress"

#: includes/class-xdwp-selftest.php:125
msgid ""
"WP-Cron is disabled in wp-config.php. That is fine as long as a real cron "
"job calls wp-cron.php — if one does not, payments will never be confirmed "
"automatically."
msgstr ""
"WP-Cron dinonaktifkan dalam wp- config.php. Itu baik-baik saja selama "
"pekerjaan cron nyata panggilan wp-cron.php - jika satu tidak, pembayaran "
"tidak akan pernah dikonfirmasi secara otomatis."

#: includes/class-xdwp-selftest.php:130
msgid ""
"Automatic verification is switched off, so every payment must be confirmed "
"by hand on the order."
msgstr ""
"Verifikasi otomatis dimatikan, jadi setiap pembayaran harus dikonfirmasi "
"dengan tangan pada pesanan."

#: includes/class-xdwp-selftest.php:137
msgid "Exchange rates"
msgstr "Laju tukar"

#. translators: %s: store currency code
#: includes/class-xdwp-selftest.php:141
#, php-format
msgid "Rates are available in %s."
msgstr "Laju tersedia dalam %s."

#. translators: %s: store currency code
#: includes/class-xdwp-selftest.php:143
#, php-format
msgid ""
"No rate could be fetched in %s. Checkout will refuse to quote until this "
"works."
msgstr ""
"Tidak ada tingkat yang bisa diambil dalam %s. Checkout akan menolak untuk "
"mengutip sampai ini bekerja."

#: includes/class-xdwp-selftest.php:147
msgid "HTTPS"
msgstr "HTTPS"

#: includes/class-xdwp-selftest.php:147
msgid ""
"This site is not served over HTTPS. Copy-to-clipboard and wallet links do "
"not work reliably without it."
msgstr ""
"Situs ini tidak disajikan di atas HTTPS. Salin-ke-papan klip dan link dompet"
" tidak bekerja dengan baik tanpa itu."

#: includes/class-xdwp-selftest.php:162
msgid "Offered at checkout"
msgstr "Ditawarkan di checkout"

#: includes/class-xdwp-selftest.php:165
msgid "Ticked on the Coins tab."
msgstr "Tick pada tab Koin."

#: includes/class-xdwp-selftest.php:166
msgid "Not ticked on the Coins tab, so customers will not see it."
msgstr "Tidak menggelitik tab Koin, sehingga pelanggan tidak akan melihatnya."

#: includes/class-xdwp-selftest.php:198 includes/class-xdwp-selftest.php:209
#: includes/class-xdwp-selftest.php:221
msgid "Somewhere to receive"
msgstr "Di suatu tempat untuk menerima"

#: includes/class-xdwp-selftest.php:201
msgid ""
"No address and no extended public key are set for this coin, so an order in "
"it cannot be created."
msgstr ""
"Tidak ada alamat dan tidak ada kunci publik diperpanjang diatur untuk koin "
"ini, sehingga urutan di dalamnya tidak dapat dibuat."

#: includes/class-xdwp-selftest.php:202
msgid ""
"An extended public key is saved but no address could be derived from it. "
"Check the key is the account key your wallet shows."
msgstr ""
"Kunci publik yang diperpanjang disimpan tapi tak ada alamat yang dapat "
"diturunkan darinya. Periksa kuncinya adalah kunci rekening yang ditunjukkan "
"dompetmu."

#. translators: %s: receiving address
#: includes/class-xdwp-selftest.php:213
#, php-format
msgid ""
"%s does not look like an address for this network. Money sent to it would be"
" lost."
msgstr ""
"%s tidak terlihat seperti alamat untuk jaringan ini. Uang yang dikirim akan "
"hilang."

#. translators: %s: receiving address
#: includes/class-xdwp-selftest.php:226
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The next order will be sent to %s. Check that address appears in your own "
"wallet."
msgstr ""
"Urutan berikutnya akan dikirim ke %s. Periksa alamat yang muncul di dompet "
"Anda sendiri."

#. translators: %s: receiving address
#: includes/class-xdwp-selftest.php:231
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Payments go to %s. Only you can confirm it is yours — send a small amount to"
" be certain."
msgstr ""
"Pembayaran pergi ke %s. Hanya Anda yang dapat mengkonfirmasi itu adalah "
"milik Anda - kirim sejumlah kecil untuk memastikan."

#: includes/class-xdwp-selftest.php:249 includes/class-xdwp-selftest.php:261
msgid "Price in this coin"
msgstr "Harga di koin ini"

#. translators: %s: store currency code
#: includes/class-xdwp-selftest.php:253
#, php-format
msgid ""
"No exchange rate is available for this coin in %s, so checkout cannot quote "
"an amount."
msgstr ""
"Tidak ada laju pertukaran yang tersedia untuk koin ini dalam %s, jadi "
"checkout tidak dapat mengutip sebuah jumlah."

#. translators: 1: fiat amount, 2: crypto amount, 3: coin symbol
#: includes/class-xdwp-selftest.php:265
#, php-format
msgid "%1$s converts to %2$s %3$s right now."
msgstr "%1$s konversi ke %2$s %3$s sekarang."

#: includes/class-xdwp-selftest.php:282
msgid "Reading the blockchain"
msgstr "Membaca blockchain"

#: includes/class-xdwp-selftest.php:285
msgid ""
"This coin has no free way to check payments, so you confirm them yourself "
"with \"Mark payment received\" on the order."
msgstr ""
"Koin ini tidak memiliki cara gratis untuk memeriksa pembayaran, sehingga "
"Anda mengkonfirmasi mereka sendiri dengan \"Mark pembayaran diterima\" pada "
"pesanan."

#: includes/class-xdwp-selftest.php:288
msgid "Nothing to look up until a receiving address is set."
msgstr "Tidak ada yang perlu dicari sampai alamat penerima ditetapkan."

#. translators: %s: name of the service whose key is missing
#: includes/class-xdwp-selftest.php:302
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Payments in this coin cannot be checked automatically until a free %s key is"
" saved under Prices & APIs. Until then you would have to confirm each "
"payment by hand."
msgstr ""
"Pembayaran dalam koin ini tidak dapat diperiksa secara otomatis sampai bebas"
" %s kunci disimpan di bawah Prices & APIs. Sampai saat itu Anda harus "
"mengkonfirmasi setiap pembayaran dengan tangan."

#: includes/class-xdwp-selftest.php:315
msgid ""
"The explorer was not contacted — a cached result was used. Try again in a "
"minute for a live answer."
msgstr ""
"Penjelajah itu tidak dihubungi - hasil cache digunakan. Coba lagi dalam satu"
" menit untuk jawaban hidup."

#. translators: 1: host, 2: error message
#: includes/class-xdwp-selftest.php:324
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Could not reach %1$s: %2$s. Payments in this coin will not be confirmed "
"automatically."
msgstr ""
"Tak bisa mencapai %1$s: %2$s. Pembayaran dalam koin ini tidak akan "
"dikonfirmasi secara otomatis."

#. translators: %s: host
#: includes/class-xdwp-selftest.php:337
#, php-format
msgid ""
"%s refused the request. This chain usually needs a free API key — add one "
"under Prices & APIs."
msgstr ""
"%s menolak permintaan. Rantai ini biasanya membutuhkan kunci API gratis - "
"tambahkan satu di bawah Prices & APIs."

#. translators: %s: host
#: includes/class-xdwp-selftest.php:349
#, php-format
msgid ""
"%s is rate-limiting this site. Payments will still be found, just more "
"slowly — an API key raises the limit."
msgstr ""
"%s adalah rate- membatasi situs ini. Pembayaran masih akan ditemukan, hanya "
"lebih lambat - kunci API meningkatkan batas."

#. translators: 1: host, 2: HTTP status code
#: includes/class-xdwp-selftest.php:361
#, php-format
msgid ""
"%1$s answered with HTTP %2$d. Payments in this coin may not be confirmed "
"automatically."
msgstr ""
"%1$s menjawab dengan HTTP %2$d. Pembayaran dalam koin ini tidak dapat "
"dikonfirmasi secara otomatis."

#. translators: %s: host
#: includes/class-xdwp-selftest.php:374
#, php-format
msgid "%s answered normally, so incoming payments can be seen."
msgstr "%s menjawab secara normal, sehingga pembayaran masuk dapat dilihat."

#: includes/class-xdwp-selftest.php:402
msgid "Confirmations before an order is paid"
msgstr "Konfirmasi sebelum perintah dibayar"

#: includes/class-xdwp-selftest.php:405
msgid ""
"This network settles a payment the moment it is validated, so one is all "
"there is to wait for."
msgstr ""
"Jaringan ini menetap pembayaran saat itu divalidasi, jadi satu adalah semua "
"ada untuk menunggu."

#: includes/class-xdwp-selftest.php:408
msgid ""
"Set to zero: an order is marked paid as soon as a payment is seen, before "
"the network has confirmed it. A payment can still disappear at that point."
msgstr ""
"Set ke nol: perintah ditandai dibayar segera setelah pembayaran dilihat, "
"sebelum jaringan telah dikonfirmasi itu. Pembayaran masih bisa menghilang "
"pada saat itu."

#. translators: %d: number of confirmations
#: includes/class-xdwp-selftest.php:417
#, php-format
msgid "Waiting for %d confirmation."
msgid_plural "Waiting for %d confirmations."
msgstr[0] "Menunggu konfirmasi %d."

#. translators: %s: PHP constant name
#: includes/class-xdwp-settings.php:110
#, php-format
msgid "Set via %s in wp-config.php"
msgstr "Set via %s dalam wp-config.php"

#: includes/class-xdwp-settings.php:117
msgid "Key saved — leave blank to keep, paste a new key, or enter - to clear"
msgstr ""
"Kunci disimpan - biarkan kosong untuk disimpan, tempelkan kunci baru, atau "
"masukkan - untuk membersihkan"

#: includes/class-xdwp-settings.php:225
msgid ""
"That webhook address was not saved: it must be a full http:// or https:// "
"address this site is allowed to reach."
msgstr ""
"Alamat webhook tidak disimpan: ini harus berupa sebuah http penuh: / / atau "
"https: / / alamat situs ini diperbolehkan untuk dicapai."

#. translators: %s: coin ID
#: includes/class-xdwp-settings.php:329
#, php-format
msgid ""
"%s settles a payment the moment it is validated, so it cannot wait for more "
"confirmations. That number was not saved — leave it at 1 or empty."
msgstr ""
"%s mengendap pembayaran saat itu divalidasi, sehingga tidak dapat menunggu "
"untuk lebih konfirmasi. Nomor itu tidak disimpan - tinggalkan di 1 atau "
"kosong."

#. translators: %s: coin ID
#: includes/class-xdwp-settings.php:361
#, php-format
msgid ""
"That extended public key for %s was not saved: it is not a public account "
"key this plugin can use (xpub, ypub, zpub, Ltub or dgub). Never paste a "
"private key."
msgstr ""
"Kunci publik yang diperpanjang untuk %s tidak disimpan: itu bukan kunci akun"
" publik plugin ini dapat menggunakan (xpub, ypub, zpub, Ltub atau dgub). "
"Jangan paste kunci privat."

#: includes/class-xdwp-updater.php:179
msgid ""
"Accept cryptocurrency payments directly to your own wallets — updates are "
"delivered from GitHub Releases."
msgstr ""
"Terima pembayaran cryptocies langsung ke dompet Anda sendiri - pemutakhiran "
"dikirimkan dari GitHub Lease."

#: includes/class-xdwp-updater.php:182
msgid "See GitHub Releases for changelog details."
msgstr "Lihat GitHub Melepaskan untuk rincian changelog."

#: includes/class-xdwp-updater.php:219
msgid ""
"Refused plugin update: package host is not an allowlisted GitHub download "
"host."
msgstr ""
"Menolak pemutakhiran plugin: host paket bukan sebuah host unduh allowlisted "
"GitHub."

#: includes/class-xdwp-updater.php:244
msgid "Refused plugin update: release SHA-256 checksum is unavailable."
msgstr "Menolak pemutakhiran plugin: rilis SHA-256 checksum tidak tersedia."

#: includes/class-xdwp-updater.php:253
msgid ""
"Refused plugin update: ZIP SHA-256 does not match the GitHub release "
"checksum."
msgstr ""
"Menolak pemutakhiran plugin: ZIP SHA-256 tidak cocok dengan checksum rilis "
"GitHub."

#: includes/class-xdwp-updater.php:269
msgid ""
"Refused plugin update: the release is not signed with the Xorro Wallet "
"Payments release key."
msgstr ""
"Menolak pemutakhiran plugin: rilis tidak ditandatangani dengan kunci rilis "
"Payment Xorro."

#. translators: 1: amount received, 2: symbol, 3: amount due, 4: remaining
#. amount, 5: txid
#: includes/class-xdwp-verifier.php:324
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Partial crypto payment: received %1$s %2$s of %3$s %2$s. Waiting for the "
"remaining %4$s %2$s (txid: %5$s). The payment window was restarted."
msgstr ""
"Pembayaran kripto sebagian: diterima %1$s %2$s dari %3$s %2$s. Menunggu sisa"
" %4$s %2$s (txid: %5$s). Jendela pembayaran dimulai kembali."

#. translators: 1: amount received, 2: amount still due
#: includes/class-xdwp-verifier.php:339
#, php-format
msgid "Received %1$s, which is short — %2$s still due"
msgstr "Menerima %1$s, yang pendek - %2$s masih jatuh tempo"

#. translators: 1: amount, 2: symbol, 3: txid
#: includes/class-xdwp-verifier.php:430
#, php-format
msgid ""
"A transfer of %1$s %2$s (txid: %3$s) arrived that could belong to this order"
" or another open order on the same address, so it was not credited "
"automatically. Check which customer sent it and use \"Mark payment "
"received\" on the right order."
msgstr ""
"Transfer %1$s %2$s (txid: %3$s) tiba yang bisa menjadi milik urutan ini atau"
" urutan terbuka lain pada alamat yang sama, sehingga tidak dikreditkan "
"secara otomatis. Periksa pelanggan mana yang mengirimnya dan gunakan "
"\"Pembayaran Mark diterima\" pada urutan yang benar."

#. translators: %s: transaction id
#: includes/class-xdwp-verifier.php:505
#, php-format
msgid ""
"A payment was seen on chain (%s) but has since disappeared — most likely "
"replaced by the sender or dropped for too low a fee. Nothing was received, "
"so the order is waiting for payment again."
msgstr ""
"Pembayaran terlihat pada rantai (%s) tapi telah menghilang - kemungkinan "
